    <item>
      <title>CF2: Valuation Preliminaries </title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/post/econfinance/corporatefinance/cf2/</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 01 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/post/econfinance/corporatefinance/cf2/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Mindmap:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-text&#34; data-lang=&#34;text&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;Chain of Questions&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id=&#34;valuation-of-bonds-and-stocks&#34;&gt;Valuation of Bonds and Stocks&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;four-methods-of-project-valuation&#34;&gt;Four Methods of Project valuation&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;free-cash-flow&#34;&gt;Free Cash Flow&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-text&#34; data-lang=&#34;text&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  &#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Annuity is a basic model,which has four categories.The pricing or valuation of bonds and stocks are based on it.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Bonds&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;行内公式：\( PV = \frac{FV}{(1+r)^T} \)&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;块公式：&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;$$ NPV = \sum_{t=1}^{T} \frac{C_t}{(1+r)^t} - C_0 $$</description>
    </item>
